    "turn_text": "an hour of truth, for the battered but proud people of the Empire State, from the financial and entertainment epicenter of New York City to the sleeping and empty small cities and towns of upstate, which once bustled with manufacturing, mining, and farming. We all know from inspiration, history, and nature, we deserve a return to the success and growth of generations past, a birthright being squandered by corruption in Albany, and the depredations of an insecure, scheming mountobank posing as Governor, who loads both us and himself. As Liberty beckons of enslaved peoples behind the Iron Curtain via American broadcasts, after World War II, we now say, believe, rise and join us. Welcome to Radio Free in New York.",
