    "turn_text": "You know, one of one of the things we normally do, we go through candidates backgrounds, but I know we've got a little bit limited time with you. So I figured I'd read off just a little bit about what I would I know about you and then let you kind of fill in any of the gaps. So, Justin Amash is elected to the House of Representatives and Michigan's third congressional district and recently changed his party to libertarian, making him the highest holding office as a libertarian in the United States, which I know has really stirred up a lot of interesting media. People are excited. People are upset. And I'll kind of turn it over to you to fill in anything else you want to add to that.",
