    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88120.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Well, there are people both excited and some people upset, of course. And the people who are upset are the people who support one of the other two major candidates, Donald Trump or Joe Biden, because They know I've got a chance to shake this race up. And I looked at this race and saw a path to victory. And that's why I got in. I think people need their rights protected. And you have two candidates who aren't protecting people's rights. They are candidates who will continue our systems the way it's going. And that's left people polarized. It's left people angry. And people don't feel like they have their same freedoms anymore. And we have to change that. We have to restore liberty to the people and allow people to make decisions for their own lives.",
