    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, they're all over the place with that. And depending on who you talk to, you get a different reaction to it. The truth is I'm running to ensure that neither of them wins. We have to have someone in the White House who will end our wars. who will reform the criminal justice system, who will protect our privacy, who will stop civil asset forfeiture, who will get our budget in check and stop all this crazy spending. And you have two candidates right now running who won't do any of that. So we need an alternative. We need someone who's going to protect the people's rights. And that's what I'm about.",
