    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88120.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, I understand where they're coming from. And a lot of them say, well, you know, this is the point of the right. We want to make sure that the government knows we're here and all that. I get that. I get what you're saying. But what you're doing is actually scaring a lot of other people in Michigan, and you turn people off in a way that then maybe turns back our gun rights, where others then run a ballot initiative to try to deny open carry and things like that. So I just want us to be careful and mindful about how we exercise our rights.",
