    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88120.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 17,
    "turn_text": "All right, welcome back to Radio Free New York. I'm your host, Andrew Hollister. We have Justin Amash here with us who's running for president for the 2020 election as a libertarian, generating a lot of interest and happy people, excited people, and some upset people too, which I think means your campaign's probably off to a good start.",
