        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Libertarian voters and independents value third-party candidacies and alternative political structures.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that having a vice presidential candidate is necessary even when running as a libertarian.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Larry Sharp is a credible and viable option for vice president within the speaker’s ideological framework.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The interview format allows space for speculative or hypothetical political questions.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views themselves as capable of leading a national campaign as a libertarian candidate.",
