    "turn_text": "there you go. You know, but what what did stand out to me besides the funny snarky comment that that definitely had me chuckling and decide that we were going to talk about this. I went and I listened to one of Cuomo's press releases. and press conferences, and one of the reporters asked about the subways. This is the MTA for those of you who maybe hear the MTA and didn't realize it's that public transit system down in New York City. Cuomo said ridership is down 92%. They only have about 8% of the population riding the MTA right now.",
