    "turn_idx": 67,
    "turn_text": "Exactly and so this this really got me thinking here about well Did we reduce costs running the MTA by 98% or 92% or more? Is the MTA going to need another giant upstate bailout as a part of this? And it really got me thinking about budgeting and how I can almost guarantee you that next year and next year's budget, they're going to want more money. from upstate to bail out the MTA yet again, because I'm sure they've mismanaged this whole system.",
