    "turn_idx": 68,
    "turn_text": "Oh, everything is going to need bailouts. First of all, I don't know if we talked about this. Do we talk about the $2 trillion stimulus program? Do we talk about how much of that money went to the actual voters? 4%. just so you know. And if you look at the itemization of the 96% that went for political purposes, you have, I'm trying to find here, 492 million went to the National Railroad Passenger Corporation, also known as Amtrak. 492 million, but that's okay. 526 million additional grants to Amtrak will remain available if needed through 2021, which you can just take that not to the bank. You know that Amtrak is going to want that 526 million. So you're over a billion dollars going to Amtrak out of the $2 trillion stimulus that just came out.",
