    "turn_text": "Yeah, and there's a lot of stories about giant corporations and even educational institutions who are highly successful, have a ton of money, very profitable, who received millions and millions and millions of dollars in relief money when small mom and pop businesses Can't even get a response from the SBA or even a confirmation that their application.",
