      },
      {
        "text": "Public trust in self-regulation outweighs institutional authority in health-related behavior.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Fear among vulnerable populations is valid but does not necessitate blanket restrictions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Social responsibility and personal freedom are compatible when grounded in awareness and choice.",
